he other screens.)\n\n**Conformance:** manifest bumped to **v1.3.0** with the new `beta_timeline` endpoint + `page_step_through` node, re-signed with the real `BENNY_HMAC_KEY`; all gating tests (integration_audit, integration_manifest, memoray_proxy) green.\n\n## Where the merge stands now\n- **Phases 0–3: complete.** One app — prime-silo vendors and auto-boots memo-ray, **all five screens are native** (Lifelog, Mission Control, Setup, Session Graph, Step-Through) under the deliberate earth-tone/dyslexia-friendly theme, MCP folded in, manifest signed.\n- **Only Phase 4 remains:** the zero-install bundle (run the vendored memo-ray under the bundled Node so a double-click EXE needs no separate install) and then archiving the standalone memo-ray repo.\n\nDocs and memory updated ([MEMORAY-MERGE.md](prime-silo/MEMORAY-MERGE.md) screen map + status + the headless-verify gotchas). The dev servers are still up — open `http://localhost:3000`, **Enter Space**, and you'll find **Step-Through** in the nav (or click \"Step through this session\" from Session Graph).\n\nWant me to tackle Phase 4 (zero-install bundle + archive memo-ray) next?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":337,"cache_read_input_tokens":425978,"output_tokens":1127,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":337,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1127,"cache_read_input_tokens":425978,"cache_creation_input_tokens":337,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":337},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcTjhGmLvg1atnQN96zwK","attributionMcpServer":"Claude Preview","attributionMcpTool":"preview_stop","type":"assistant","uuid":"150fd024-bde1-4530-9d62-0fad45faa791","timestamp":"2026-06-