ls/<page>.yaml`).\n\nmemo-ray screens (client/src/components) → native target:\n- AgentLifelog + HeatmapRadar → **DONE (2a)**: `widgets/memoray/heatmap_radar/` +\n  `mod/_prime_silo/lifelog/`. eslint clean; data shapes verified vs booted server\n  (/lifelog 200 items, /heatmap-stats days+stats). **In-shell live render VERIFIED**\n  (memo-ray 3030 + shell `node space serve` 3000 + preview browser → renders themed,\n  200 posts + 365-cell radar + stats via /api/memoray proxy, teleport deep-links to\n  Memory, 0 console errors). Gotcha: shell gates behind /enter — set\n  sessionStorage['space.enter.tab-access']='1' to bypass for headless verify.\n- Mission Control (BetaDashboard landing) → **DONE (2b)** `mod/_prime_silo/mission_control/`\n  (overview_cards + heatmap_radar + omnibar + live 10s sync). Verified in-shell (7 cards,\n  365 radar, themed).\n- Step-Through Audit PLAYER → **DONE** `mod/_prime_silo/step_through/` — full port: timeline\n  grouping, hero-text, Why?, diff/raw content, milestone scrubber (≤600), playback (1-20×),\n  ←/→ keyboard, gamepad, speech narrator, lineage_graph map highlighting current node via\n  data-node-id (+scrollIntoView when Tracking). Deep-link ?session_id, picker fallback,\n  \"Step through\" button on session_graph. Verified in-shell (Step 3 of 800, tracks, 0 errors).\n  Folded organic force-layout into the single layered lineage_graph map.\n- SetupWizard → **DONE (2c)** `mod/_prime_silo/setup/` over /setup/*. Verified (9 cards,\n  all paths ✓Found). Needed proxy POST whitelist for /setup/save + /open-folder.\n- Session Graph → **DONE (2d)** `mod/_prime_silo/session_graph/` (reuses lineage_graph).\n  Verified (191 sessions, SVG graph mounts).\n- OverviewGrid → already ported = `widgets/memoray/overview_cards` (pre-existing).\n\n**THEME (owner cares)**: created shared scoped `memoray_client/memoray-theme.css`\n(`.mray-theme`) — earth tones + dyslexia/ADHD-friendly typography + Anthropic restraint;\nre-binds shell tokens within memo-