urces/memoray/server`.\nVerified: node --check + eslint clean, memoray_proxy_test green, ps1 parse OK.\n**Unverified:** live packaged build (desktop:pack → launch → auto-start/tray/quit).\n\n**Phase 2 = make ALL memo-ray screens native** (owner directive 2026-06-27, \"not\njust the bridge\", \"decouple the architecture in the same application\"). prime-silo\npages are **Alpine.js**, NOT React → native = reimplement each React screen as the\n3-layer pattern: shared `memoray-client.js` (data) → `widgets/memoray/<name>/`\n(vanilla `{update,refresh,destroy}` factories) → thin Alpine page\n`mod/_prime_silo/<page>/` (view.html + <page>.js + .css + `ext/panels/<page>.yaml`).\n\nmemo-ray screens (client/src/components) → native target:\n- AgentLifelog + HeatmapRadar → **DONE (2a)**: `widgets/memoray/heatmap_radar/` +\n  `mod/_prime_silo/lifelog/`. eslint clean; data shapes verified vs booted server\n  (/lifelog 200 items, /heatmap-stats days+stats). **In-shell live render VERIFIED**\n  (memo-ray 3030 + shell `node space serve` 3000 + preview browser → renders themed,\n  200 posts + 365-cell radar + stats via /api/memoray proxy, teleport deep-links to\n  Memory, 0 console errors). Gotcha: shell gates behind /enter — set\n  sessionStorage['space.enter.tab-access']='1' to bypass for headless verify.\n- Mission Control (BetaDashboard landing) → **DONE (2b)** `mod/_prime_silo/mission_control/`\n  (overview_cards + heatmap_radar + omnibar + live 10s sync). Verified in-shell (7 cards,\n  365 radar, themed).\n- Step-Through Audit PLAYER → **DONE** `mod/_prime_silo/step_through/` — full port: timeline\n  grouping, hero-text, Why?, diff/raw content, milestone scrubber (≤600), playback (1-20×),\n  ←/→ keyboard, gamepad, speech narrator, lineage_graph map highlighting current node via\n  data-node-id (+scrollIntoView when Tracking). Deep-link ?session_id, picker fallback,\n  \"Step through\" button on session_graph. Verified in-shell (Step 3 of 800, tracks, 0 errors).\n  Folded organic force-layout into the single layered lineage_graph map.\n- SetupWizard → **DONE (2c)** `mod/_prime_silo/setup/` over /setup/*. Verified (9 cards,\n  all paths ✓Found). Needed proxy POST whitelist for /setup/save + /open-folder.\n- Session Graph → **DONE (2d)** `mod/_prime_silo/session_graph/` (reuses lineage_graph).\n  Verified (191 sessions, SVG graph mounts).\n- OverviewGrid → already ported = `widgets/memoray/overview_cards` (pre-existing).\n\n**THEME (owner cares)**: created shared scoped `memoray_client/memoray-theme.css`\n(`.mray-theme`) — earth tones + dyslexia/ADHD-friendly typography + Anthropic restraint;\nre-binds shell tokens within memo-ray page subtree. Applied to ALL memo-ray pages.\nVerified --accent/--sage/Inter/heat-ramp resolve in-shell. (Shell was washing it out.)\n\n**Phase 3 DONE**: vendored mcp-server data-reader fixed to read ~/.memoray/data (was\nhardcoded to upstream ../agent-os-dashboard layout); registered via prime-silo/.mcp.json;\nsmoke-tested (live sessions returned).\n\n**Manifest re-signed** v1.2.0 (new endpoints + process_map nodes). CRITICAL: sign with\n`BENNY_HMAC_KEY` from prime-silo/.env (running server verifies with it) — fallback key →\nlive signature drift. All gating tests green. Known flake: audit health probe of\n/ecosystem/manifest times out cold (~12s >5s) → false \"unreachable\"; warm it.\n\nWidget UX fix: overview_cards + heatmap_radar got silent refresh(true) so the 10s live\nsync doesn't flash loading state.\n\n**Adaptive graph DONE** (owner request): lineage_graph gained layoutMode auto|linear|force\n(+forceThreshold default 60). auto → layered SVG small / free-floating force_graph_2d\n(glow+minimap, the \"drilldown\" look) large. Highlight+camera-track in both (SVG is-current\n+scrollIntoView; force rust glow +centerAt via new props.track path). step_through drives it\nvia widget.update({highlightIds,track,layoutMode}) + Auto/Linear/Free toggle. Default\nlayoutMode='linear' so memory/session_graph unchanged. Verified: 800-node→force canvas+minimap,\ntoggle→SVG, 0 errors.\n\n**Phase 4 DONE (zero-install)**: memo-ray is plain Node → memoray_service spawns it via\nprocess.execPath + ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE (Electron IS node, no download/runtime-bundle needed).\npackage.json extraResources ships memoray/server + a SEPARATE node_modules entry (electron-\nbuilder parent glob skips nested node_modules!); sample data/ excluded (real data ~/.memoray).\ndesktop-builder ensureMemorayServerDeps() installs deps pre-pack if missing. VERIFIED: desktop:pack\n--dir succeeds, bundle has server+68 deps, bundled copy boots 200, EXE present. GUI auto-boot =\n1 manual step left.\n\n**Repo-retire DECIDED AGAINST (owner 2026-06-27): keep standalone memo-ray repo** (people may\nwant a standalone memory-graph). So prime-silo/memoray/ is an INTENTIONAL vendored FORK (snapshot,\nwill drift). To pull upstream fixes: re-copy memo-ray/agent-os-dashboard/server → prime-silo/\nmemoray/server (KEEP the prime-silo edit to mcp-server/data-reader.js for ~/.memoray/data). To run\nstandalone instead of the child: set MEMORAY_DIR (memoray.ps1/dev.ps1 honour it). Do NOT archive.\n\nMERGE COMPLETE — all phases done (0-4 + adaptive graph). Nothing outstanding except optional\nfuture re-vendoring when upstream memo-ray changes.\n\nRelated: [[project_open_studio_opencode_audit]] (memo-ray's 4-seam audit pattern,\nopencode/open-notebook), [[memo_ray_token_audit_validation]],\n[[project_bridge_4k_studio_observability]] (Bridge cockpit already native).\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":94,"oldLines":6,"newStart":94,"newLines":20,"lines":[" --dir succeeds, bundle has server+68 deps, bundled copy boots 200, EXE present. GUI auto-boot ="," 1 manual step left."," ","+**RELEASED prime-silo v1.4.2** (2026-06-27): 15 assets, all 6 installers (win x64/arm64 .exe,","+mac x64/arm64 .dmg, linux x64/arm64 AppImage) + updater yml + zero-install runtime bundle.","+Two CI-only packaging bugs hit first (local Windows desktop:pack masked bot